Identified. Rod is credited (with Rafael Rico) on «fiesta 8 bit» in Los Humanoides' «cmyk ver_11.11.11» / «CMYK ver 111111» (Caracas-based band, released 11-11-2011); his own Bandcamp-declared location context names Caracas, Venezuela.

